Z||000000||1FieroGTRacingInc||01-10-2001||09:08 AM||||how much hp/tourqe does this motor produce , compared to our 2.8L???  Would the swap be worth the $$$$$ and effort doing???  If anyone has the particular's I would be estatic....   Thank's   Steve<P>------------------<BR>1FieroGTRacingInc.||||reg||5
Z||000001||lou_dias||01-10-2001||12:26 PM||||I believe it's 160 hp and 185 ft*lbs of torque||||reg||1
Z||000002||88formula||01-10-2001||05:19 PM||||If it's the Lumina with the iron heads its 140 HP and 180 ft. lbs. of torque. If it has the aluminum heads than it makes 160 HP and 185 ft. lbs. of torque. The latest version I think makes 180 HP and I don't remember the torque.<P>The difference is not in the peak numbers but in part throttle torque and horsepower. The 3.1-liter engine makes allot more bottom end power than the 2.8-liter engine. <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||1FieroGTRacingInc||01-10-2001||08:58 PM||||Thank's for the information...  Steve<P>------------------<BR>1FieroGTRacingInc.||||reg||6
Z||000004||lou_dias||01-10-2001||11:14 PM||||Isn't it weird that the latest 3.1's make 175 hp and the 3.4 is still stuck at 180...?||||reg||1
Z||000005||88formula||01-11-2001||05:50 PM||||No because the 3.1 and 3.4 are very close in displacement. The 3.4 is actually a 3.3 and they have the same stroke. ||||reg||1
